<title>USA: TABLE-HMH Properties sells $600 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-HMH Properties sells $600 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from HMH Properties Inc, a unit of Host Marriot Corp, was priced on Thursday via lead manager Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER HMH PROPERTIES</p>
<p>AMT $600 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/07</p>
<p>TYPE SR NOTES	ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 8.875 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD +264 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
